-- Research report 133, fault 2: 400 writes, each of the list the one before answered. v3 passes its
-- module budget after about 85 of them, and then its walk still takes about 18 s (LLVM ReleaseSafe);
-- 2 000 of them take more than 120 s. The time is spent in `Frame.markAtomIn`, under `demand`.
